1
00:00:15,168 --> 00:00:20,780
Salut, Marinette. Tu as une idée pour le projet ?
Hi, Marinette. Do you have an idea for the project?

2
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:25,988
Oui. Je pense que le jardin est joli.
Yes. I think the garden is pretty.

3
00:00:26,088 --> 00:00:29,084
Je crois que tu as raison.
I believe you are right.

4
00:00:29,184 --> 00:00:34,148
Merci ! Et toi, quel est ton avis ?
Thanks! And you, what’s your opinion?

5
00:00:34,248 --> 00:00:38,900
Je trouve que le plan est bon, mais je ne comprends pas tout.
I think the plan is good, but I don’t understand everything.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,708
D’accord. Cette partie est peut-être un peu difficile.
Okay. This part may be a little difficult.

7
00:00:44,808 --> 00:00:49,148
C’est vrai. Le dessin est faux ?
That’s true. Is the drawing wrong?

8
00:00:49,248 --> 00:00:52,508
Non, il est correct !
No, it’s correct!
